    "blurb": "Streamline scheduling with public holidays",
    "overview": "Integrate public holidays and long weekends seamlessly into Camunda processes with the Public Holiday Connector. Leverage Nager.Date API to keep your global teams and processes in sync with over 100 countries' holiday schedules.",
    "rating": null,
    "reviewCount": 0,
    "mobileBundleId": null,
    "mobileAppStoreId": null
  },
  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Leverage Public Holiday Data for Scheduling in Critical Business Processes",
    "splashDescription": "Take the guesswork out of scheduling tasks around public holidays. The Public Holiday Connector, which uses the Nager.Date API, offers an intuitive way to use public holiday data in business processes that are orchestrated by Camunda. Whether you're coordinating international teams or managing event timelines, this Connector ensures that public holidays and long weekends are always accounted for.",
    "imageUrl": "https://d3bql97l1ytoxn.cloudfront.net/app_resources/419279/overview/img7493388419518391437.png?efdb1e140ff42f4aed0fbd1c09c8c274",
